### Create scholarship application
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "student_scholarship",
  "fullName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "email": "juan@up.edu.ph",
  "contactNo": "09171234567",
  "details": {
    "studentNumber": "202612345",
    "program": "BS Computer Science",
    "yearLevel": "3rd",
    "reasonForApplying": "I need financial assistance to complete my studies at UP and sustain my daily academic needs.",
    "supportingNotes": "Consistent dean's lister"
  }
}

### Create student account application
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "student_account",
  "fullName": "Maria Santos",
  "email": "maria@up.edu.ph",
  "contactNo": "09181234567",
  "details": {
    "studentNumber": "202654321",
    "program": "BS Engineering",
    "reasonForAccount": "I want to access the platform for my coursework and scholarship-related coordination."
  }
}

### Create admin account application
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "admin_account",
  "fullName": "Ana Reyes",
  "email": "ana.reyes@example.com",
  "contactNo": "09191234567",
  "details": {
    "affiliation": "Faculty",
    "reasonForAdminAccess": "I need to manage scholar records and review incoming applications for our unit.",
    "supportingNotes": ""
  }
}

### Get all applications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications

### Get pending applications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications?status=pending

### Get all student scholarship applications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications?type=student_scholarship

### Get single application
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}

### Review application
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "reviewNotes": "Verified and ready for the next step."
}

### Approve scholarship application (triggers Scholar creation)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications/{{scholarshipApplicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "reviewNotes": "Applicant meets all criteria for scholarship."
}

### Approve student account application (triggers Member creation)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications/{{studentAccountApplicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "reviewNotes": "Student approved for platform access."
}

### Approve admin account application (triggers admin role grant)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/applications/{{adminAccountApplicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "reviewNotes": "Granted admin access for application review."
}
